  data: {
    LLM: "1. Lead: Player to dealer's right leads.\n2. Follow Suit: You must follow suit if possible.\n3. Mandatory Trumping: If you cannot follow suit, you MUST play a trump if you have one. If you have neither the suit nor trumps, you may discard any card.\n4. Over-Knaves: These always belong to the trump suit, regardless of their printed suit logo.",
    Player: "1. Lead: Player to dealer's right leads.\n2. Follow Suit: You must follow suit if possible.\n3. Mandatory Trumping: If you cannot follow suit, you MUST play a trump if you have one. If you have neither the suit nor trumps, you may discard any card.\n4. Over-Knaves: These always belong to the trump suit, regardless of their printed suit logo.",
    objective: 'Collect as many Aces and Tens as possible. There are 8 total points (4 Aces, 4 Tens).',
    gameplay: "1. Lead: Player to dealer's right leads.\n2. Follow Suit: You must follow suit if possible.\n3. Mandatory Trumping: If you cannot follow suit, you MUST play a trump if you have one. If you have neither the suit nor trumps, you may discard any card.\n4. Over-Knaves: These always belong to the trump suit, regardless of their printed suit logo.",
